{
  "name": "Day 61 Solution: Notion Automation",
  "description": "Three Notion automations: AI-generated database record creation, update-by-page-ID, and full AI-written page creation, each triggered by its own webhook.",
  "tags": [
    "week9",
    "real-tools",
    "notion",
    "webhook",
    "openai"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 61 Solution: Notion Automation\n\nThree independent webhook-triggered sections on this canvas: create a database record from raw text (AI-generated fields), update an existing record by page ID, and create a full Notion page with AI-written content.\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** Notion API (internal integration token, shared with your target database/page), OpenAI API key.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_61_Notion_Automation.md for the full task.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "property-types-sticky",
      "name": "Notion Property Types",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Watch the property types\n\nNotion's API is picky about property shapes: a `select` property needs `{ \"name\": \"value\" }`, not a bare string; `title`/`rich_text` need Notion's rich-text array shape. The n8n Notion node's field mapper UI handles this for you when you pick property names from the dropdown -- avoid hand-building raw property JSON where you can.\n\nAlso: share the target database/page with your integration first, or every call below 404s.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-record-sticky",
      "name": "Section A: Create Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Create Record\nRaw text in -> AI structures it -> Notion database row out.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-record-webhook",
      "name": "Notion Create Record Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "notion-create-record",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-record-content",
      "name": "Generate Record Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        680,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You turn raw notes into a structured content record. Respond ONLY with strict JSON: {\"title\": string, \"description\": string, \"tags\": string[], \"summary\": string}. No other text."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $json.raw_text }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "maxTokens": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-record-content",
      "name": "Parse Generated Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        940,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).title }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "description",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).description }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "tags",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).tags }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "summary",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).summary }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-database-record",
      "name": "Create Database Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "create",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_database_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "title": "={{ $json.title }}",
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Description|rich_text",
              "textValue": "={{ $json.description }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Tags|multi_select",
              "multiSelectValue": "={{ $json.tags }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Status|select",
              "selectValue": "New"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update-record-sticky",
      "name": "Section B: Update Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Update Record\nModify an existing row by its Notion page ID.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update-record-webhook",
      "name": "Notion Update Record Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        680
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "notion-update-record",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "update-database-record",
      "name": "Update Database Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        680
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "update",
        "pageId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.pageId }}",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Status|select",
              "selectValue": "={{ $json.status || 'Updated' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Description|rich_text",
              "textValue": "={{ $json.description }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-page-sticky",
      "name": "Section C: Create Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Create Page\nFull AI-written page content, not just a database row.",
        "height": 110,
        "width": 260
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-page-webhook",
      "name": "Notion Create Page Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        960
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "notion-create-page",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-page-content",
      "name": "Generate Page Content",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        680,
        960
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You write a full page of well-structured content (heading + several paragraphs) from a short brief. Respond ONLY with strict JSON: {\"page_title\": string, \"page_body\": string}."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ $json.brief }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.5,
          "maxTokens": 800
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-notion-page",
      "name": "Create Notion Page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        940,
        960
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "page",
        "operation": "create",
        "pageId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_parent_page_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "title": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).page_title }}",
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": []
        },
        "blockUi": {
          "blockValues": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).page_body }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Notion Create Record Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Record Content",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Generate Record Content": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse Generated Content",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Generated Content": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Database Record",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Notion Update Record Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update Database Record",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Notion Create Page Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Page Content",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Generate Page Content": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Notion Page",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "versionId": "1",
  "id": "day_61_solution"
}